# LF in the index and in every working tree, including Windows. `dotnet format`
# enforces `end_of_line = lf` from .editorconfig, so a CRLF checkout would fail CI
# formatting verification on a developer machine but pass on the Linux runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
